 daily rewards, free spins, and massive jackpots.\n\n- Progress through levels to unlock new slots and bigger prizes.\n\n- Social lounge features let you connect, play, and celebrate with friends in VR.\n\nWhether you\u2019re chasing jackpots, enjoying themed slots, or exploring the buzz of a virtual casino floor, Jackpot VR delivers nonstop thrills. Put on your headset and step into the future of Vegas-style slots\u2014anytime, anywhere.", "short_description": "Step inside the ultimate virtual casino where the excitement of Las Vegas comes alive in stunning virtual reality. Jackpot VR transforms classic slot play into a fully immersive experience\u2014spin, win, and celebrate in a vibrant 360\u00b0 casino environment."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.playbonkers.com/privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Bonkers LLC", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.playbonkers.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1676485315806614"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["GAMEPAD", "OCULUS_TOUCH", "TRACKED_KEYBOARD"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "24360535133639509"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1115318274024308"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1115318274024308"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1759170660, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1115318274024308"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"